  "description": "Infused with over 40 years of experience and pedigree, the Switchback Sport is a well-rounded, comfortable hardtail MTB designed with everything a rider needs to take on single track trails or put in mile after mile on crushed gravel paths – all at an excellent value.\nThe Switchback Sport is a comfortable, well-rounded hardtail MTB perfect for newcomers to trail riding. Suggested rider height by size: SM: 5’2” – 5’6”, MD: 5’5” – 5’10”, LG: 5'9\" – 6'2.\nLightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame with internal cable routing and replaceable dropout hanger\nShimano Tourney 2 x 8 drivetrain with 3-piece Prowheel aluminum cranks.\nXposure 80 mm travel fork with steel steerer lockout.\n27.5\" x 2.1\" Xposure tires on aluminum double wall rims with mechanical disc brakes.",
